  "extract": "Jonathan William Coulton, often called \"JoCo\" by fans, is an American folk/comedy singer-songwriter, known for his songs about geek culture and his use of the Internet to draw fans. Among his most popular songs are \"Code Monkey\", \"Re: Your Brains\", \"Still Alive\", and \"Want You Gone\". He was the house musician for NPR weekly puzzle quiz show Ask Me Another from 2012 until its end in 2021.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Jonathan William Coulton</b>, often called \"<b>JoCo</b>\" by fans, is an American folk/comedy singer-songwriter, known for his songs about geek culture and his use of the Internet to draw fans. Among his most popular songs are \"Code Monkey\", \"Re: Your Brains\", \"Still Alive\", and \"Want You Gone\". He was the house musician for NPR weekly puzzle quiz show <i>Ask Me Another</i> from 2012 until its end in 2021.</p>"
